      *; setup: CRTDTAARA DTAARA({lib}/R3DTA) TYPE(*CHAR) LEN(10) VALUE('START')
      *; cleanup: DLTDTAARA DTAARA({lib}/R3DTA)
      * DEFN: *LIKE and *NAMVAR; IN and OUT of a data area.
     H
     FQSYSPRT O   F     132     OF     PRINTER
     C                     Z-ADD12.5      BASE    51
     C           *LIKE     DEFN BASE      COPY  + 2
     C                     Z-ADD1234.5    COPY
     C           *NAMVAR   DEFN R3DTA     DTA    10
     C           *LOCK     IN   DTA
     C                     MOVE DTA       BEFORE 10
     C                     MOVEL'CHANGED' DTA
     C                     OUT  DTA
     C                     IN   DTA
     C                     EXCPTLINE
     C                     SETON                     LR
     OQSYSPRT E  1             LINE
     O                         COPY  J   10
     O                         BEFORE    25
     O                         DTA       40
